    {
      "id": "msg_0543_T20R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Elm: Hi, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "I’ve been waiting for you!\r",
        "Do you know anything about\n",
        "my research?\r",
        "As you know, Pokémon are carried\n",
        "in Poké Balls these days.\r",
        "But before the Poké Ball was invented,\n",
        "people used to walk with Pokémon.\f",
        "Just like your friend Lyra does!\r",
        "Poké Balls are great because you can\n",
        "carry many Pokémon.\r",
        "But walking with Pokémon must have\n",
        "some advantages.\r",
        "It could have something to do with how\n",
        "Pokémon grow or evolve...\r",
        "So I’m going to give you a Pokémon!\r",
        "Can you walk beside this Pokémon,\n",
        "outside of its Poké Ball, to see if this\f",
        "brings any special feelings or bonds\f",
        "between Pokémon and people?\r",
        "The device over there has some Pokémon\n",
        "you could choose from...\r"
      ]
    },
