      "en_US": [
        "Professor Elm: Hey, listen.\n",
        "I have this acquaintance that people\f",
        "call Mr. Pokémon.\r",
        "He keeps finding weird things and\n",
        "raving about his discoveries.\r",
        "Anyway, I just got an email from him\n",
        "saying that this time it’s real.\r",
        "It’s probably another Pokémon Egg,\n",
        "but we’re still so busy with our\f",
        "Pokémon research...\r",
        "Wait!\n",
        "I know!\r",
        "You can go in our place, right?\n",
        "Can we count on you?\r",
        "You can choose one of the Pokémon\n",
        "over there.\r"
